WEBVTT

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.320
Please, shoot Nadia!

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:41.080
But can you shoot Nadia?

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.970
I can't do it!

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:03.310
I'm sorry.

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:07.270
I can't shoot.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.900
Nadia, wake up! Nadia!

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.360
Jean...

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:19.700
Even your love can't bring her consciousness back.

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.530
Ever!

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.080
Now, out of the mercy of my heart,

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:31.960
I will give you one more chance to live a long life.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.090
As the king of Atlantis,

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.970
will you do as I say with these foolish human beings?

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:43.430
Will you follow the true way together with us?

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:46.890
The answer is the same as thirteen years ago.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:48.100
I say no!

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.360
What a fool!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.020
Have you not woken up yet?

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.400
Don't make light of human beings, Gargoyle!

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.490
They are not so foolish as you imagine.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:05.950
I don't think so. In fact, that boy couldn't shoot Nadia.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:11.580
He should have shot her in order to accomplish your purpose.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:15.590
No! That shows the tenderness of humans and their virtue.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:20.550
They don't need it. You don't need it, either.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.140
Well, you must leave us now.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:28.520
I will let you hear your son's voice before you die.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:32.850
This is a final present from me as a friend.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:37.280
Venusis!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:46.870
I am the Emperor of Neo Atlantis, Neo Icon Epiphanes.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.540
Gargoyle, did you...

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:58.550
You are right. Your son is now only my puppet.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:03:59.760
You bastard!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.510
Now, Neo, Nadia! Shoot Nemo!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:11.270
Captain!

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:18.570
How does it feel to be killed by your own children?

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:24.360
I am allowing you to die by your children's hands.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:27.240
I did it out of my friendship for you.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.750
New Nautilus, do you hear me?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.960
New Nautilus, do you hear me?

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.800
Yes, this is Nautilus!

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.760
First Officer, are you okay?

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.970
Yes, you know where I am?

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.970
Yes, we can trace you.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:50.600
Target 60 degrees to my left and fire the electron turret.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.270
That's crazy!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.770
You'll be killed!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.770
We'll be saved if luck is with us.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.690
We'll be killed anyway as things stand.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:58.730
Please fire!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:00.190
But...

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:03.240
Hurry! The captain is going to be killed!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:06.740
Understood.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:17.330
How is it, Nemo? Well made?

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:21.050
The scientific product of Neo Atlantis.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.010
This is from science?

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:28.140
Yes, his body was destroyed by Nemo

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:32.430
thirteen years ago when he destroyed the Tower of Babel.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:36.770
I've helped him with our scientific knowledge.

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.270
We've let him live for thirteen long years.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.610
You have no reason to think ill of me.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.990
You should be grateful instead.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.780
Now, go to Hell!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.560
What happened?

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:27.820
I never imagined we would be hit directly by the main turret.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.570
I was careless.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:37.200
New Nautilus aimed at the control system.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:52.720
Father?

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.680
Impossible! This can't be happening!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.310
Father?

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.600
I destroyed his soul.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:04.270
It's impossible for him to regain consciousness.
It's...

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.360
A miracle!

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:08.860
Father...

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.820
Take care of Nadia.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:37.390
Wake up, Nadia. Nadia!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:42.690
It's no use. Unless you break the control system, she won't wake up.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.250
Damn you!

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:12.930
Which fool was it who changed my body into iron?

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.850
Venusis!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:09.520
My dear Neo, you're just a mechanical puppet after all!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.280
You can't even move without electricity.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.530
The miracle is over now.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:20.660
Just try to move your finger. You can't.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.580
Now, go to Hell in that position.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.380
Impossible!

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.720
That's absurd!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:43.720
Does man's will transcend science?

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.740
Venusis!

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:00.530
Nadia...

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:02.910
Nadia!

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:09.540
Who...

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:16.510
I'm sorry, Nadia.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:19.970
Brother?

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.930
I leave the matter to you.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:23.560
Brother!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:26.560
I wish I could live with human beings.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:28.770
Brother!

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.240
A miserable end for those fools.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:51.040
NO!

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:07.730
Now, Princess Nadia.

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:09.690
This is the end of the story.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:17.690
This is bad! It's going to plummet into the atmosphere.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.360
Red Noah won't be able to survive at that angle of descent!

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.750
There's only one way left.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.090
As the Emperor Neo has died,

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:39.760
you will be the successor to the Blue Water, Princess Nadia.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.220
You killed him!

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:46.680
I didn't need him anymore.
That's why I got rid of him.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.430
Now, Princess Nadia.

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:50.770
Put the Blue Water back in its proper place,

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:53.650
and set this ship on the correct course.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:55.690
No.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:59.150
You don't care about them?

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:03.610
I will bring down this ship as the successor to the Blue Water.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:05.660
You're right, Nadia!

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:10.870
Don't worry about us. I'm sure the New Nautilus will save us!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.460
We can go back to Earth together!

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:14.670
Jean...

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:19.260
You are a brave boy as always, but foolish at the same time.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:22.170
You don't want to die, do you?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.300
It's you who are foolish!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:28.390
You believe everything will happen as you wish.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:32.810
But you can't control human hearts as you do machines.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:36.400
My father and my brother sacrificed their lives for their beliefs.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.480
I will follow their will.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:40.990
I won't obey your orders!

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:43.450
I don't think so.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:13:01.710
Electra!

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:06.760
She's barely alive.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.470
Are you going to put back the Blue Water now?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.560
You monster!

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:16.440
You're wrong. I'm carrying my plan out rationally.

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:18.980
Now, Princess Nadia.

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:25.650
No!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:31.370
Oh, well. You must now regretfully look upon the death of your love.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.670
NO!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:49.850
The New Nautilus?

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.240
Jean! Jean!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.370
Please, answer me!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:14.870
Jean!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.560
Nadia...

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:40.150
You can use this.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:46.860
Pray to the two Blue Waters.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.820
They will answer you.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:55.580
But if you lose the protection of the Blue Water, you will be...

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.330
Don't worry about me.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.250
But...

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:08.720
Nadia, you should save the boy you love first.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:11.180
That's the way girls are.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.890
Electra...

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.730
No! Stop it!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:00.980
Gargoyle!

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:06.400
The Blue Water will forever lose its brilliance if you do that.

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:14.160
No! Stop it!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.280
My dream!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:20.000
My hope!

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:21.960
Don't let it die!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:27.540
Don't! Only an Atlantean can survive within that light!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:38.100
What? What is this? Why am I turning into salt?

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.060
It can't be...

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:45.480
That's right. There are only two Atlanteans in this world.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:50.030
Nemesis La Algol, you are, in truth, human.

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:52.990
You mean all I've been doing was...

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:55.450
It's wonderfully ironic isn't it?

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.910
What can Nadia and two aliens do?

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.370
This world belongs to human beings now.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:06.670
I see. Goodbye...

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.930
Who is it who awakens me now?

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.060
Nadia?

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:26.650
Yes. Please, save Jean!

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:29.770
But he is already dead.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.980
But Captain Nemo said he would be all right.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.360
Please, save Jean!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:38.200
But you'll lose the Blue Water if that happens.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:42.910
You must give up all the power given to you as an Atlantean.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.420
It means you cannot be a god.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:49.540
I don't care! I don't want it!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.960
Please, save Jean!

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:55.510
I understand.

00:17:56.220 --> 00:18:00.680
The Blue Waters are a repository for the souls of Atlantis.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.720
We will give him our lives.

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:06.230
Goodbye, Nadia.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:08.900
Mother?

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:38.130
Jean!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.470
Jean, thank goodness!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:47.430
Captain!

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:51.190
Captain! Captain Nemo!

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:57.860
I'm okay. Get to the ship quickly!

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:01.910
Hurry.

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:04.370
Yes...

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.530
The left stabilizer is damaged!

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:43.990
Engine power has dropped to point two percent!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.990
It's no use! We can't move anymore!

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.950
Damn it! Is this the end?

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.710
Don't give up!

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:54.130
That's right! We must get back alive!

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:56.290
But...

00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:00.050
Yes, there is still hope.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:34.250
Electricity connected to the New Nautilus.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.000
Energy charge commencing.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.630
Thirty seconds to launch.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.800
Where's Captain Nemo?

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.880
I stay here.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:51.560
I will destroy the launching spot with the New Nautilus to help you get out.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:53.190
Captain!

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:54.640
Nadia...

00:20:55.810 --> 00:21:00.690
This is all I can do for you as a father.

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:02.860
I'm sorry.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:06.280
No, I'll stay with you!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:08.240
I want to be with you!

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.660
Shut up!

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:11.620
Please...

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:15.580
Please understand.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.970
Miss Grandis...

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:28.260
Yes?

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.850
Please look after the children.

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:33.850
Yes...

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:38.440
Electra, no, I mean Medina.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:40.150
Yes?

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.530
Take care of things after I'm gone.

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:48.030
Yes...

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:03.510
Nadia, whatever may happen, LlVE!

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:04.020
Jean...

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:06.650
Thank goodness!

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:11.990
Where am I?

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:14.700
In a spaceship.

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:16.660
A spaceship?

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:21.370
Yes, we're going back home to your world.

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:30.340
No, Nadia.

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:32.890
Our world.

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:34.510
Jean...

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.730
That's where you were born. We are both people of the Earth.

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:44.480
Jean!

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:49.780
A shooting star!

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:53.160
What did you wish for?

00:23:53.820 --> 00:23:58.040
I asked that Sanson and everyone else could come back soon.

00:23:58.040 --> 00:23:59.250
How about you?

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:01.460
The same as yours.

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:08.340
And I also asked that we may never have an experience like this again.

00:24:11.510 --> 00:24:13.260
I really do too.

00:24:34.820 --> 00:24:37.450
This is the end of the story,

00:24:37.450 --> 00:24:40.540
but I will tell you what happened after that.

00:24:41.450 --> 00:24:44.420
Twelve years have passed since that day.

00:24:44.420 --> 00:24:47.960
The new Nautilus was sunk into the Japan Deep.

00:24:48.460 --> 00:24:52.880
Each of the crew is now leading a happy life.

00:24:52.880 --> 00:24:55.760
The radar operator and the nurse are together now.

00:24:55.760 --> 00:24:59.720
Electra is bringing up her child earnestly.

00:25:00.600 --> 00:25:06.350
Jean and Nadia got married five years ago. They live in Le Havre.

00:25:09.150 --> 00:25:13.030
Jean is still absorbed in inventions with his uncle,

00:25:13.030 --> 00:25:16.610
and Nadia and his aunt are always scolding them.

00:25:20.120 --> 00:25:25.420
Nadia still cannot eat fish or meat.

00:25:26.250 --> 00:25:28.040
It's not right, after all!

00:25:29.460 --> 00:25:33.670
Senorita Grandis is still enjoying her single life.

00:25:34.340 --> 00:25:38.680
She continues looking for a true love.

00:25:38.680 --> 00:25:41.390
Hanson started an automobile company.

00:25:41.390 --> 00:25:44.230
Now, he's the richest of all!

00:25:44.230 --> 00:25:49.270
He told me he was looking forward to finding a beautiful wife.

00:25:50.320 --> 00:25:54.360
Ayerton has gone back to England, and became a successor to a house.

00:25:54.360 --> 00:25:57.780
I didn't know he was a true count!

00:25:57.780 --> 00:26:00.910
You want to know about Sanson?

00:26:01.950 --> 00:26:03.540
Well, about that...

00:26:04.870 --> 00:26:09.880
He got married to me, Marie Lowenbrau.

00:26:11.710 --> 00:26:17.380
And I'm going to follow Nadia and become a mother next year!

00:26:20.350 --> 00:26:24.470
After all, my dream was to enjoy a walk in the neighborhood park

00:26:24.470 --> 00:26:26.890
on Sunday with my family.

00:26:29.650 --> 00:26:31.610
See you again!
